Playwright
----------

Source:  https://github.com/microsoft/playwright (ported from v1.62.0)
License: Apache License, Version 2.0
         https://github.com/microsoft/playwright/blob/v1.62.0/LICENSE

Files containing code derived from Playwright:

  src/webview-dom-js.ts (in the published package: dist/webview-dom-js.js;
  the role list is also bundled into dist/trace-viewer/ and dist/ui-mode/)
    - the ARIA role list (ARIA_ROLES), from Playwright's validRoles;
    - the "Roles, accessible names and labels, as Playwright computes them"
      section of the in-page WebView helpers: implicit and explicit ARIA
      roles, hidden-from-accessibility checks, the accessible name
      computation, label texts, and whitespace and text matching.
  These are derived from Playwright's packages/injected/src/roleUtils.ts and
  packages/injected/src/selectorUtils.ts (Copyright (c) Microsoft
  Corporation).

These files were modified by the Tapsmith contributors: the code was
translated from TypeScript modules into one script evaluated inside a WebView
over the Chrome DevTools Protocol (Android) and the WebKit Inspector protocol
(iOS), adapted to Tapsmith's locator options, and some features were left out
(CSS ::before/::after content, aria-owns and aria-describedby).

